		(property "Description" "MiCS-4514 dual gas (CO/reducing + NO2/oxidizing) sensor breakout, 5-pin analog style (VCC/GND/RED/NOX/PRE), e.g. ACROBOTIC MiCS4514 breakout. RED/NOX are raw analog sensor outputs (need external pull-down + your own ppm conversion); PRE is the heater control input (PWM from host). This is NOT the DFRobot Gravity I2C variant (SEN0377), which instead exposes VCC/GND/SDA/SCL." (at 299.72 321.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
