	(no_connect (at 535.94 215.9) (uuid "213e6555-f41c-5d75-aa8f-913d66b43a24"))
	(text "WeAct STM32G474CEU6 Long (A1): 5V from PS1 into P3 VDD5V (pins 43/44). 3V3 from the on-board LDO (P4 pins 47/48, P5 pin 52).\nPin map: clear-air.ioc + README \"STM32G474CEU6 Pin Plan\". On-board only: PC6 user LED (LED_BOARD), PC13 user key, PB8 BOOT0 key,\nPA11/PA12 USB-C, PF0/PF1 8 MHz HSE, PC14/PC15 LSE. VREF+ (pin 37) tied to 3V3 so the ADCs read against 3.3V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "502a1d97-eb91-5cca-997b-f23c61f72e02"))
	(text "I2C1: PA15 SCL / PB7 SDA. SPS30 SEL=GND (I2C, 0x69); BME680 SDO=3V3 (0x77), CS=3V3. 4k7 pull-ups to 3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "243732f3-38f8-5e55-bd93-822687aa6b09"))
	(text "5V outputs -> 1k8 (series) / 3k3 (to GND) divider -> 3.24V max at MCU pin:\nMQ131 AO -> PA0 (ADC1_IN1), MiCS RED -> PA1 (ADC2_IN2), MiCS NOX -> PA7 (ADC2_IN4), RobotDyn Z-C -> PB0 (EXTI0)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3871ab3e-4ce4-5f49-8861-3354221e38b4"))
	(text "Buzzer: PB15 (BUZZER_IN) -> R9 -> Q3. Q3 inverts: PB15 HIGH -> buzzer OFF; LOW -> R16 pulls IRFZ44N gate to 12V -> buzzer ON.\nMiCS-4514 PRE <- PB12 (MICS_PREHEAT). Cold/warm boot button SW2 -> PB14 (BOOT_MODE, pull-up). Gate PB1 (TRIAC_DIMMER) -> RobotDyn PSM." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "271c2dbd-78bc-55da-a774-def13076086d"))
	(text "J2 = STLINK-V3MINIE STDC14: 3 T_VCC, 4 SWDIO, 5/7/11 GND, 6 SWCLK, 12 T_NRST, 13 T_VCP_RX, 14 T_VCP_TX; 1/2/8/9/10 unused.\nSWD goes to the board P5 header (SWCLK/SWDIO/3V3/GND). USART2 VCP: PA2 TX -> T_VCP_TX, PA3 RX <- T_VCP_RX.\nUSART3 (future Arduino link): PB10 TX / PB11 RX through 2N7000 level shifters Q1/Q2." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ea359ce6-a477-5ddc-86e8-6134661f9193"))
	(text "220VAC mains split: J1 -> RobotDyn TRIAC (fan) and PS1 AC-DC (12V buzzer, 5V board + peripherals).\nPS1 pins: 1 L, 2 N, 3 +12V, 4 +5V, 5 GND. M2 40mm fan runs all the time. JP1: bridge 1-2 for a 5V fan, 2-3 for a 12V fan." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9c7a92c2-2f06-54d7-b8d7-bf4eabe74f93"))
	(text "HIGH VOLTAGE: J1, PS1 pins 1-2, RobotDyn IN/N/OUT, M1 carry 220VAC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 430 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b9d78abb-c294-51c2-9de3-52d4b88838d1"))
